<title>UK: GECC sets A$100 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets A$100 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    07.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.86    PAY DATE    07.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
